From 230b14120cd4a35f4aaabf058bd44e82f2050fa4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohamed Bana <mohamed.omar.bana@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 12:57:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] netfilter: add nf_conntrack_{qos,tcp_no_window_check} to
 sysctl table

Without this patch networking, at the least, within the newly created
namespace is broken. One encounteres the following stackes when starting
a container:

